### 5.3 叙事节奏监控

```python
def check_narrative_pacing(chapters):
    """分析最近N章情绪曲线，判断是否需要作者干预"""
    emotional_scores = [analyze_emotion(ch) for ch in chapters[-20:]]

    alerts = []
    if len(set(emotional_scores[-10:])) <= 2:
        alerts.append("⚠️ 连续10章情绪无波动，建议投放 conflict/awakening 卡牌")
    if all(s > 0 for s in emotional_scores[-15:]):
        alerts.append("⚠️ 连续15章无挫折，建议投放 disaster 卡牌")
    if all(s < -0.3 for s in emotional_scores[-8:]):
        alerts.append("⚠️ 连续8章处于低谷，建议投放 awakening 卡牌")
    return alerts
```

